### Login valido (200)
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "maria", "senha": "maria123" }

### Login invalido (401) - repetir 2x para bloquear
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "joao", "senha": "errada" }

### Trocar senha (publico)
PUT http://localhost:8080/trocarsenha/maria
Content-Type: application/json

{ "atual": "maria123", "nova": "nova123" }

### Cadastrar usuario (ROLE_MANUTENCAO)
POST http://localhost:8080/
Authorization: Basic manutencao manut123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "carlos", "senha": "carlos1" }

### Listar usuarios (ROLE_MANUTENCAO)
GET http://localhost:8080/
Authorization: Basic manutencao manut123

### Desbloquear usuario (ROLE_ADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:8080/unlock/joao
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### Metricas
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
